  "description": {
   "en": "Palace Maid X Empress\n\nSu Zhiqing was born with breathtaking beauty. Upon entering the palace she failed to rise to the top and was sent to the Cold Palace, a place for unwanted things. There she met the person she would swear her heart to for the rest of her life. For the sake of that person, she hid her own brilliance and willingly became their servant, to stand by their side.\n\nXiao Wuchen met a young maid near the Cold Palace gate. The maid was stunningly beautiful with clear, bright eyes. Beneath her palace attire, her slender waist was so delicate that one could barely encircle it with a hand, and even if seen only once, was enough to make one long for her..."
  },
